  "title": "LifeMax",
  "category": "trigger",
  "trigger": "LifeMax",
  "description": "<p>ステート実行者が持てる最大ライフ値を整数で返します。</p><p>通常はキャラクター定義の <code>[Data]</code> / <code>life</code>（<code>Const(Data.Life)</code>）に基づきますが、チームモードなど状況によっては補正されることがあります。</p><p>リダイレクト（例: <code>Enemy,LifeMax</code>）を付けた場合は、その評価対象の最大ライフを返します。</p>",
  "syntax": [
    "LifeMax"
  ],
  "images": [
    {
      "src": "mugen_life_trigger_system_diagram.png",
      "width": "640",
      "height": "480",
      "alt": "Life/LifeMax と LifeAdd/LifeSet/TargetLifeAdd の関係、およびステート -3〜通常ステートの処理順序を示す図。",
      "visibility": "internal"
    }
  ],
  "associated_trigger": [
    "Life",
    "Const"
  ],
  "associated_state": [
    "LifeAdd",
    "LifeSet",
    "TargetLifeAdd"
  ],
  "version": [
    {
      "no": "Ikemen GO (Nightly, 2025-12-12 報告)",
      "content": "<p><code>LifeSet</code>/<code>LifeAdd</code> と <code>TargetLifeAdd</code> の実行優先度が、MUGEN 1.1 と異なる可能性が報告されています。<code>LifeMax</code> を用いたライフ固定・復帰（例: <code>LifeSet value = LifeMax</code>）を行う設計では、互換性確認を推奨します。</p>",
      "blockquote": "https://github.com/ikemen-engine/Ikemen-GO/issues/2957"
    }
  ],
  "code_sample": [
    {
      "title": "現在ライフが最大値の1/4未満のときの判定",
      "code": [
        "Trigger1 = Life < LifeMax / 4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "メディスン・メランコリー（相手側変数参照）を用いた周期ダメージ例",
      "description": "<p>相手の変数を参照し、最大ライフ比率で周期的にダメージ量を組み立てる例です。最大ライフに連動させることで、ライフ設定が異なる環境でもスケールします。</p>",
      "code": [
        "[State -2]",
        "Type       = LifeAdd",
        "TriggerAll = Enemy,Name=\"Medicine Melancholy\"",
        "Trigger1   = GameTime%8 =0",
        "value      = -Ceil(LifeMax/1000)*(Enemy,var(55))-Ceil(LifeMax/1000)*(Enemy,var(57))",
        "Kill       = 0",
        "Absolute   = 1"
      ],
      "visibility": "internal"
    },
    {
      "title": "コンボ連携数の条件として使う（処理頻度を変化）",
      "description": "<p>最大ライフと現在ライフの差分を用い、処理頻度（<code>Persistent</code>）の値を変化させる例です。</p>",
      "code": [
        "[State 000];中弾ばらまき（奥",
        "Type           = Explod",
        "Trigger1       = fvar(0) = 0.7",
        "Trigger1       = Time >= 80",
        "Anim           = 13047",
        "PosType        = P1",
        "Pos            = -40+(Random%60),90-(Random%240)",
        "Scale          = 0.6,0.6",
        "Ownpal         = 1",
        "Vel            = 0.1*(20+(Random%30))*Cos((-60+Random%120)*PI/180),0.1*(-40+(Random%80))*Sin((-60+Random%120)*PI/180)",
        "SprPriority    = 0",
        "IgnoreHitPause = 1",
        "Persistent     = 45 - Floor((Root,LifeMax-Root,Life)/50)"
      ],
      "visibility": "internal"
    },
    {
      "title": "青回復（回復量を最大ライフ比率で制限）",
      "description": "<p>削りダメージを変数に記録し、一定間隔で最大ライフ比率の上限付き回復（青回復）を行う例です。</p>",
      "code": [
        ";削りダメージ記憶",
        "[State -2]",
        "Type           = VarAdd",
        "Trigger1       = var(1)>=0 && (StateNo=150||StateNo=152||StateNo=154)",
        "Trigger1       = GetHitVar(Damage)>0",
        "var(1)         = GetHitVar(Damage)+Floor( GetHitVar(Damage)*(fvar(17) - 1.0) )",
        "IgnoreHitPause = 1",
        "",
        ";削りダメージ発生時回復不能時間出現",
        "[State -2]",
        "Type           = VarSet",
        "Trigger1       = var(1)>=0 && (StateNo=150||StateNo=152||StateNo=154)",
        "Trigger1       = GetHitVar(Damage)>0",
        "var(2)         = 300",
        "",
        ";削りダメージ発生時回復不能時間減算",
        "[State -2]",
        "Type           = VarAdd",
        "Trigger1       = var(2)>0 && (StateNo!=[150,155])",
        "var(2)         = -1",
        "",
        ";時間切れ",
        "[State -2]",
        "Type           = LifeAdd",
        "Trigger1       = RoundState=3 && (WinTime||EnemyNear,WinTime)",
        "value          = var(1)",
        "IgnoreHitPause = 1",
        "",
        "[State -2];青回復",
        "Type           = LifeAdd",
        "Trigger1       = var(1)>0 && (StateNo!=[150,155])&&(StateNo!=[500,501])&&GameTime%20=0&&var(2)=0",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3100&&(Time=[1,40]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3101&&(Time=[1,50]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3200&&(Time=[8,58]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3201&&(Time=[8,49]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3300&&(Time=[4,47]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3301&&(Time=[4,47]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3302&&(Time=[18,61]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3303&&(Time=[25,68]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3500&&(Time=[10,62]))",
        "value          = IfElse(var(1)<5*((LifeMax)/1000.0),var(1),Ceil(5*((LifeMax)/1000.0)))",
        "Absolute       = 1",
        "IgnoreHitPause = 1",
        "",
        "[State -2];青回復分減少",
        "Type           = VarAdd",
        "Trigger1       = var(1)>0 && (StateNo!=[150,155])&&(StateNo!=[500,501])&&GameTime%20=0&&var(2)=0",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3100&&(Time=[1,40]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3101&&(Time=[1,50]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3200&&(Time=[8,58]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3201&&(Time=[8,49]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3300&&(Time=[4,47]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3301&&(Time=[4,47]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3302&&(Time=[18,61]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3303&&(Time=[25,68]))",
        "Trigger1       = !(StateNo=3500&&(Time=[10,62]))",
        "var(1)         = -IfElse(var(1)<5*((LifeMax)/1000.0),var(1),Ceil(5*((LifeMax)/1000.0)))",
        "IgnoreHitPause = 1",
        "",
        "[State -2];回復値リセット",
        "Type           = VarSet",
        "Trigger1       = var(1)>0 && MoveType=H && (StateNo!=[150,155]) && (StateNo!=[0,190])",
        "Trigger2       = RoundState=3 && (WinTime||EnemyNear,WinTime)",
        "Trigger3       = var(1) < 0",
        "var(1)         = 0",
        "IgnoreHitPause = 1",
        "",
        "[State -2];回復不能時間リセット",
        "Type           = VarSet",
        "Trigger1       = var(1)=0",
        "var(2)         = 0",
        "IgnoreHitPause = 1"
      ],
      "visibility": "internal"
    },
    {
      "title": "ライフを最大ライフ比率で固定減少させる",
      "description": "<p>最大ライフの <code>1/1000</code> を、2フレームに1回減算する例です（最大ライフが大きいほど減少量も増えます）。</p>",
      "code": [
        "[StateDef -2]",
        "[State ];ライフ自動減少",
        "Type           = LifeAdd ;ライフ増減",
        "value          = -Ceil(LifeMax/1000) ;最大の1000分の1",
        "Trigger1       = GameTime % 2 = 0 ;2フレームに1回（最大ライフ1000で約2000フレーム）",
        "Trigger1       = RoundState = 2 ;試合中",
        "IgnoreHitPause = 1 ;ヒットポーズ無視"
      ],
      "visibility": "internal"
    },
    {
      "title": "ライフを半分にする（ラウンド開始前）",
      "description": "<p>ラウンド開始前（試合前・暗転中）に現在ライフを最大値の半分へ設定する例です。</p>",
      "code": [
        "[StateDef -2]",
        "[State ];ライフセット",
        "Type     = LifeSet ;ライフ指定",
        "Value    = Floor(LifeMax/2) ;体力半分",
        "Trigger1 = RoundState = 0 ;試合前・暗転中"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "体力を8割にする（ラウンド開始前）",
      "description": "<p>ラウンド開始前に現在ライフを最大値の8割へ設定する例です。</p>",
      "code": [
        "[StateDef -2]",
        "[State ];ライフセット",
        "Type     = LifeSet ;ライフ指定",
        "Value    = Floor(LifeMax*0.8) ;体力八割",
        "Trigger1 = RoundState = 0 ;試合前・暗転中",
        ";*1=100% *0.5=50% のように指定可能。Valueを特定数値にしても可。",
        ";※最大値より増やすことはできません。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "根性補正の条件分岐（最大ライフ比率で分岐）",
      "description": "<p>現在ライフ/最大ライフ比率を用いて補正値を分岐する例です。</p>",
      "code": [
        "[State ];根性補正 敷居40最大補正35",
        "Type           = VarSet",
        "Trigger1       = !IsHelper",
        "fvar(19)       =",
        "IfElse((Life*1000/(LifeMax)<=400),IfElse(Helper(60000),var(19)=0,(1-0.35)+(0.35*Life/(LifeMax*0.40)),1),1)",
        "IgnoreHitPause = 1",
        "Persistent     = 1"
      ],
      "visibility": "internal"
    },
    {
      "title": "最大ライフの25%未満を小数の割合で比較する",
      "description": "<p>1.0/1.1の式の例です。0.25を掛けることで比較基準はfloatとなり、整数除算による基準値の切り捨てを避けます。</p>",
      "code": [
        "Trigger1 = Life < LifeMax * 0.25"
      ]
    }
  ],
